  "bodyHash": "43827a297bc4a944",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:normal\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_57061d46-61a4-4e42-9e92-c0947c1ce522.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"701\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;text-align:left\"><strong>《远古锻造大师》</strong>引入了一套独特的强力可升级遗物，为玩家提供新工具与机制以拓展玩法。这些鎏金物品具备实用的能力与功能，而丰厚的升级系统更能助你策略性地培养心仪的遗物！</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:normal\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_f15b5563-ccb7-4625-98c0-3bf5a5204104.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"476\" height=\"471\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">⚜️ <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">鎏金遗物</span></span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">经验收藏徽章</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_441fadb2-afac-4aeb-902f-36d8c7dfcabb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"93\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 允许持有者储存经验值。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 装备于副手时，可储存双倍的经验球。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">折跃灯笼</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\"><strong style=\"text-indent:-0.25in\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_9d7c795b-68db-4af0-adc1-f58a1e409002.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"69\" height=\"93\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 赋予持有者传送能力，并可与其他实体互换位置。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 放置后可作为传送锚点使用。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">活力灵药</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_e454b2d3-811f-4287-889e-1afb9a9fc5dc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"63\" height=\"93\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 饮用后永久增加最大生命值。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 对余烬之花使用时，可复活你失去的同伴。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">呼啸头盔</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_2be596c1-f9a8-493b-ad4f-c5b259fa3a2e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"79\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 受到致命伤害时，为佩戴者提供短暂的生存窗口，用于调整位置、逃脱或规避死亡。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 使骷髅对佩戴者产生恐惧。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">肆虐利爪</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_9cc43107-0c79-405a-a405-518a470a214b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"99\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 持有者生命值越低，激活该能力时造成的伤害越高。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">昭雪之盾</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_76ba14c6-02f4-438c-a919-fb86216f8271.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"63\" height=\"130\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 盾牌蓄力时可反弹攻击。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 装备于主手时，盾牌将始终处于蓄力状态，但威力减半，且耐久消耗速度翻倍。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">回响护符</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_c512480c-d21c-45bc-ab40-e471d2f9fe54.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"86\" height=\"92\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 召唤类似监守者的灵魂来保护佩戴者。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 对同伴使用时，可授予其永久守护能力。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">铁缚手套</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_83ad2f82-c201-4b24-9192-898e6dafb276.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"136\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 通过攻击目标或方块积累蓄力值。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong> 对目标使用蓄力时，会将目标击飞至持有者面朝的方向。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong> 对方块使用蓄力时，会将持有者推向相反方向。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">附魔典籍</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_32a7c33b-6753-46d8-ace0-1a940b2d5013.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"116\" height=\"89\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 允许持有者突破原版限制，通过转移、复制和强化附魔来进一步操控附魔效果。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">⚜️ <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">掉落物/战利品</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:Symbol\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_c853e8a5-cb19-49c7-9a34-c66687d00de2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"692\" height=\"138\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_f92b63d8-a4a9-444b-86c7-cee9a75fdd1e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"692\" height=\"138\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">遗迹遗物</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 可在<strong>黑石神庙</strong>、废墟传送门、埋藏的宝藏以及主世界的考古挖掘中找到，下界的堡垒遗迹中亦有产出。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">劫掠兽角</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 由<strong>劫掠兽</strong>掉落。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">狼毛</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 由<strong>狼</strong>在自行晾干毛发时掉落。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">灵魂石</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 由<strong>悦灵</strong>掉落。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">原始灵魂石</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 由<strong>监守者</strong>掉落。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">铁根</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 由<strong>铁傀儡</strong>掉落。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">⚜️ <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">更多特色！</span></span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_77a698fd-f5e3-4bc2-9dec-639fba157700.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"194\"><br>\n<h6 style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</h6>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">锻造祭坛</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 用于升级<strong>鎏金遗物</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 可与垂直相邻的锻造祭坛连接。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210419/description_c7d6a557-f6c5-4143-a391-ec03ffd5bb2d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"576\" height=\"433\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">黑石神庙</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#x27\">✛</span></strong>&nbsp; 生成于<strong>平原</strong>生物群系。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 style=\"line-height:normal;text-align:left\">本模组将持续更新，计划引入新物品与功能，非常欢迎您在我们的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/yf9kddksdT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>中留下建议、想法或反馈任何问题！</h5>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:normal\"><strong>您可以在整合包中使用《远古锻造大师》！</strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>",
